{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2086f27d5a1d62e47d06c821b37974c18693c0c76266c23e79bb4a41b8672d0e", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "daf52421155d7a8b70c1859c8d57909e53f1cf285a327e17b7679434ac9651eb", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n今日は確か事務所に向かわれるはずじゃ……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n今天不是应该要去办公室吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "78ed6543442647e349823e800b2ac4843083450792510091aeed60eca9e32e06", "ja": "はい。社長との打ち合わせに必要な資料だけ、\nここでささっとまとめようと思って。", "zh": "是的。我想先在这里迅速整理一下和社长开会所需的资料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1004_null", "source_sha256": "3e97330a410fa05a3f7c2e45318365adb0337430ba7b7370995caff00a88c1eb", "ja": "カタカタ……", "zh": "咔哒咔哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "a6f0689c7932b61ac455800da5b8eff9aa5082a74972b2b603a59ac3c88d8b16", "ja": "……。画面に映っているのは……\n新しい企画書ですか？", "zh": "……。屏幕上显示的是……\n新的企划书吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9ee1a2f4397910c5b3855ac7cacac5b9e6edde64ca0b2bb4f4bea35a486c2d70", "ja": "そうなんです。地方のお客さんも増えましたから、\n配信にも力を入れようと考えているんです。", "zh": "是这样的。因为外地的观众也增加了，所以我在考虑，要在直播方面多下点功夫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "8ef98e687f00db5707e4fc0407bc0b1928020929c615808aadf1464e30524f68", "ja": "それ、私もちょうど考えてたんです！\n何か配信でお手伝いできないかなって……。", "zh": "这个我也正好在考虑！\n我在想，有没有什么能通过直播帮上忙的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "3e33172c1fb4bd8e7038bdb83bafbe7bebf5704f1a2a08513fa22fb6e4f2b4b8", "ja": "私ならやっぱり衣装関係……『100万着\n仕立てるまで終わらない配信』とか……！", "zh": "要说我的话，果然还是和服装有关的……比如“在做出100万套服装之前不会结束的直播”之类……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "578f9ceec7745fa7c65f5a8d5a5104545f2adc579d1e3c201ce2c007e91f0cc4", "ja": "そ、それはちょっと視聴者が驚くというか、\n青羽さんの体が心配というか……。", "zh": "那、那样的话，观众会吓一跳的……我也有点担心青羽小姐的身体……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7e33b35da35f9ce1cf882617e923beac2cbcc11ebb9ba654c0ef29bf648649d2", "ja": "でも、アイディアは助かります！\n何か決まったら、その時はよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "不过，您的点子帮大忙了！\n如果定下了什么，到时候就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "2c44602b494f786b2e34157bf3af877ef74169d2e89bf83d5b9c95473ee13d97", "ja": "はい！　なんでも力になりますから！\n社長さんとの打ち合わせ、頑張ってくださいね～！", "zh": "好的！无论是什么我都会帮上忙的！\n和社长的商谈，请加油哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "251c0e8cfd3bc053cfc31ffccf1f51c0b0c4896ecbde1382276d7bb72b5c49eb", "ja": "……なるほど。配信系の企画か……\n君からも、こういった提案をされるとはね……。", "zh": "……原来如此，是直播类企划啊……\n没想到你也会提出这样的建议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "573f0cad3a0b6cf6bfe5a0fd86d7d5ecada229472b67e76d87c02d4cea45b85f", "ja": "はい。様々な層にアピールするためにも……\n……あの、君から「も」と仰いましたか？", "zh": "是的。为了吸引各个群体……\n……那个，您刚才说的是“也”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "e395ff3b99c5c6a8fe7c31535268cacb40e66b0d51bca34d6d34a83031c99e08", "ja": "うむ。実は、私の知り合いが配信番組を\nプロデュースしていてね。", "zh": "嗯。其实，我的一位熟人正在担任网络节目的\n制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "9a63edcb6350813269b0084706e3cca4e5f1f3c2050a12eed6aa6c2589b5a940", "ja": "各業界からゲストを呼び、化学反応を起こす内容の……\nチャンネル登録者数1000万に迫る人気番組だ。", "zh": "邀请来自各行各业的嘉宾，引发化学反应……\n这是订阅人数逼近1000万的人气节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "f8c8292fc2f19ae731cad6d055b11f70600267c6ae34eab0bebb3eddf934e02e", "ja": "その番組、私も知ってます！　様々な分野を横断しての\nゲストトークは、よく話題になりますからね。", "zh": "那个节目我也知道！因为横跨各个领域的嘉宾访谈经常会成为热门话题呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "7a4c907fe1287a59dd71cb139b9b2ea0fbfd8a82b44edc9bc7285b046493e8d4", "ja": "うむ。その番組の、アイドル部門のゲストとして\n我が765プロにも打診が来たというわけだ。", "zh": "嗯。那个节目的偶像部门也向我们765事务所发来了作为嘉宾的意向问询。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "491537b510818ac327ec6281011959805426684baead4043b2ece9b2664a67c0", "ja": "それは……！\nまさしく渡りに船、というやつでは……。", "zh": "那真是……！\n这不正是雪中送炭吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "e00fa00ddf77aaa797087e014a227c4de254a261836c06cc6de7ac1b85db0df1", "ja": "宣伝効果は高いだろう。\nしかし、今回のテーマが『先輩と後輩』でね。", "zh": "宣传效果应该会很高吧。\n不过，这次的主题可是“前辈与后辈”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "833aed034de068796dbd599d8d5068ccf6524642aa27952f5e09c3ee7c523b10", "ja": "『先輩と後輩』……。\nなるほど……。", "zh": "“前辈与后辈”……\n原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c704ef5fa240371ebde6714ba9e7e6fdc47da0a4c225d9c827e35d7cbbe7a886", "ja": "39プロジェクトのみんなは、大いに努力しています。\n活躍も目覚ましくなってきたところなのに……。", "zh": "39项目的大家，都非常努力。\n而且才刚刚开始崭露头角……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "cff6b68a13b58220d1a9b86b03bb8b97504713090259bcbcb44813a6ec1271b9", "ja": "ここでまた『先輩と後輩』を押し出すのは……\nあまり、いいタイミングでは……。", "zh": "都到这个时候了，还要再次强调“前辈和后辈”……似乎不太是个好时机……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "3db12e22a2fe958aa3dd3ded20df4d0876f73aec21bb855f249cb781976cf813", "ja": "まさしく、私も同じ懸念を抱いている。\nやや後ろ向きに見えるかもしれない、とね。", "zh": "确实，我也抱着同样的顾虑。\n可能会让人觉得稍微有些消极，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "8e8421e30c7a98aea4cce162b44ae2225b991dd1dad9965fab11b37883120511", "ja": "ふふっ、ふたりそろってしかめっ面して。\nそうしていても、答えは出ないと思いますよ？", "zh": "呵呵，两个人一起皱着眉头。\n就算这样，我觉得也想不出答案哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "f9daf9f0a9086c63adafdda0825db19546b0fa9da0a4018b2b0f33fda18fcc4f", "ja": "心配なら、直接聞いてみたらどうですか？\n今回のオファーをもらったふたりに。", "zh": "如果担心的话，直接去问问看怎么样？\n问问收到这次邀约的两位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "9fa80deb29e47f72fae3c042b364beaadb7e71a73dffa10ff3fbf9bad8e20656", "ja": "そうか、そうですよね……。\n当人たちの意思を無視して話を進めても……。", "zh": "这样啊，确实是这样……  \n如果无视当事人的意愿就推进下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "82d3a0b4536e8ef8426ca2e166fa97b4461312dd83139a35c4faf6efe5b905bb", "ja": "意味のない事、だったね。\n音無君の言うとおりだ。", "zh": "毫无意义呢。\n正如音无君所说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "c90ee11b7bde4341f7a215a7485fa64def86825610ab04354fec4cd055972c1d", "ja": "今回の案件は、本人たちの判断に任せよう！\nもしもOKとなった際は……。", "zh": "这次就让她们自己决定吧！\n如果她们同意的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "512a0c9844aeeb31c413699ab8dcdbfa955e2a520c0028b53b8c51669be1128a", "ja": "『アイドル業界にこのふたりあり！』……と、\n広めるきっかけとするべく、尽力してくれたまえ！", "zh": "为了让“偶像界里有这两位在！”的名声\n广泛传播开来，请你全力以赴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "e36a63ad3672ffa7433b237f2e5eece145e4b9c14c41f1224a06fba4f167246e", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！", "zh": "好的，那是当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0257_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0257_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "bbe319044cf27f6366f9c75681c4989ef4c6b12334f8232821a69eaff34a1301", "ja": "（懸念はあるが、大きなチャンスでもあるぞ。\nまずはふたりとミーティングをしないとな……！）", "zh": "（虽然有所顾虑，但这也是一个重大的机会。首先得和她们两个人开个会才行……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
